            // P7-DZ-004's 25.8 months also gives 3). Ccgt [P7-DZ-011] [P7-FX-011]
            // [P7-FX-013] [P7-US-010]: Tebessa (El Aouinet), a planned
            // launch-of-works budget envelope, 184.09e9 DZD / 1,406,017 kW =
            // 130,930 DZD/kW / (131.6059 / 0.884969 = 148.7124 DZD per EUR) =
            // 880.4 EUR/kW x (600 / 921 = 0.65147) = 573.6, so 574 EUR/kW x
            // 500,000 kW = 287,000,000. Build [P7-DZ-012] [P7-US-011]: the
            // planned 48-month execution period x (4 / 22) = 8.73, so 9, clamped
            // to the ceiling: 6 months (ruling 1, sourced as planned; P7-DZ-013
